TMB Fortran translation provenance
=================================

Upstream package: TMB 1.9.25 (Template Model Builder)
Upstream authors/copyright holders: Kasper Kristensen and contributors listed in DESCRIPTION;
Bradley M. Bell for bundled CppAD portions; Robert Gentleman, Ross Ihaka and the R Development
Core Team for spline-related upstream code; see the original TMB inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Upstream URL: https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp
Upstream license: GPL-2 for TMB. The original distribution also bundles separately licensed
third-party components. No third-party CppAD, Eigen, CHOLMOD, BLAS, LAPACK, ARPACK, R, or Rcpp
