This translation preserves algorithmic provenance for portable numerical components derived from
TMB headers including distributions_R.hpp and tmbutils/{density,interpol,kronecker,matexp,romberg,
order}.hpp. The original C++ automatic-differentiation engine, template compiler/runtime glue,
R interface, plotting/interactive functions, CHOLMOD integration, and bundled third-party source
are intentionally not copied.

The Fortran source is distributed under GPL-2.0-only, matching the TMB code from which these
algorithms were translated. See LICENSE.
